    <chapter>
      <title>Documentation</title>
      <simpara>
        Project documents are authored in DocBook 5.1.
        Use <code>simpara</code> as the default paragraph element.
        Indent with two spaces.
        Every file must end with a newline.
      </simpara>
      <section>
        <title>Project layout</title>
        <variablelist>
          <varlistentry>
            <term><filename>documentation/shared/</filename></term>
            <listitem>
              <simpara>
                Shared fragments included via XInclude.
              </simpara>
            </listitem>
          </varlistentry>
          <varlistentry>
            <term><filename>documentation/templates/</filename></term>
            <listitem>
              <simpara>
                Document templates.
              </simpara>
            </listitem>
          </varlistentry>
          <varlistentry>
            <term><filename>documentation/tools/</filename></term>
            <listitem>
              <simpara>
                Toolchain (XSLT, schemas, and so on).
              </simpara>
            </listitem>
          </varlistentry>
          <varlistentry>
            <term><filename>documentation/01-vision/</filename></term>
            <listitem>
              <simpara>
                Vision document.
              </simpara>
            </listitem>
          </varlistentry>
          <varlistentry>
            <term><filename>documentation/05-change-control/</filename></term>
            <listitem>
              <simpara>
                Change control records.
              </simpara>
            </listitem>
          </varlistentry>
          <varlistentry>
            <term><filename>documentation/07-contributions/01-people/</filename></term>
            <listitem>
              <simpara>
                Contributor files, one XML file per person.
              </simpara>
            </listitem>
          </varlistentry>
        </variablelist>
      </section>
      <section>
        <title>Shared content</title>
        <simpara>
          Reusable fragments live in <filename>documentation/shared/</filename> and are included via XInclude:
        </simpara>
        <programlisting language="xml"><![CDATA[<xi:include href="../shared/fragment.xml"/>]]></programlisting>
      </section>
      <section>
        <title>Glossary</title>
        <simpara>
          A document's glossary must contain every term referenced in the document body, plus every term in the same connected component of the <code>glossseealso</code> graph.
          <code>glossseealso</code> links are bidirectional: if entry A links to B, entry B must also link back to A.
        </simpara>
      </section>
      <section>
        <title>Bibliography</title>
        <simpara>
          A document's bibliography must contain only entries cited in the document body.
        </simpara>
      </section>
      <section>
        <title>Changelogs</title>
        <simpara>
          Project-authored files without a built-in changelog mechanism (such as <code>revhistory</code>) carry a footer changelog in Keep a Changelog format, using User Story numbers instead of release versions.
          The union of authors across all changelog entries must equal the SPDX copyright holders of the file.
        </simpara>
        <simpara>
          Use <code>&lt;!-- --&gt;</code> for XML and XSL files, <code>/* */</code> for CSS files, and <code>#</code> for files using line comments such as TOML and <filename>.gitignore</filename>:
        </simpara>
        <programlisting language="xml"><![CDATA[<!--
  # Changelog

  ## User Story N — YYYY-MM-DD

  ### Authors

  - Author Name

  ### Added

  - ...
-->]]></programlisting>
      </section>
    </chapter>
    <chapter>
      <title>Writing</title>
      <simpara>
        Project documents use British typography with American phrasing.
      </simpara>
      <itemizedlist>
        <listitem>
          <simpara>
            First-level quotations use single quotes; second-level quotations use double quotes.
          </simpara>
        </listitem>
        <listitem>
          <simpara>
            Use em dashes (—) for parenthetical content, not en dashes (–).
          </simpara>
        </listitem>
        <listitem>
          <simpara>
            Use the Oxford comma in lists of three or more items.
          </simpara>
        </listitem>
      </itemizedlist>
    </chapter>
    <chapter>
      <title>Change Control</title>
      <section>
        <title>Branching</title>
        <simpara>
          The main branch is <literal>canon</literal>.
          Feature branches follow the naming convention:
        </simpara>
        <programlisting><![CDATA[<team>/<narrative-type>/<github-id>-<branch-label>]]></programlisting>
      </section>
      <section>
        <title>Commit messages</title>
        <simpara>
          The title line must not exceed 72 characters including the newline.
          All other lines must not exceed 80 characters including the newline.
          Every commit message has exactly one <code>--</code> line describing the state before, one <code>=></code> line describing the state after, and at most one <code>*</code> line for optional additional information:
        </simpara>
        <programlisting><![CDATA[<title>
-- <state-before>.
=> <state-after>.
* <additional-information>.
[<team>: <narrative-type> <github-id>]]]></programlisting>
        <simpara>
          Example:
        </simpara>
        <programlisting><![CDATA[Factorise reusable snippets from the vision document
-- Other documents will have the same author, publisher, or introduction.
=> Extracted shareable fragments for reuse via XInclude.
* Enhanced phrasing along the way.
[Product: User Story 9]]]></programlisting>
      </section>
    </chapter>
    <chapter>
      <title>Licensing</title>
      <simpara>
        The project is REUSE-compliant.
        Licence texts are stored in <filename>LICENSES/</filename> using SPDX filenames.
      </simpara>
      <simpara>
        For project-authored files that can carry headers:
      </simpara>
      <itemizedlist>
        <listitem>
          <simpara>
            Set the SPDX <code>License-Identifier</code> to <literal>GPL-3.0-or-later</literal>.
          </simpara>
        </listitem>
        <listitem>
          <simpara>
            Use <code>FileCopyrightText</code> to credit Chrysalide Learning and the author.
          </simpara>
        </listitem>
      </itemizedlist>
      <simpara>
        Preserve upstream copyright notices in third-party files.
        Use <filename>REUSE.toml</filename> for files that cannot carry headers, such as binaries or Markdown, or for upstream notices that are not REUSE-compliant.
      </simpara>
    </chapter>
